            "airframe.empty_mass_kg": {"value_basis": "sourced", "source_ids": ["csg-us-mh60s-navair"], "tier": "A", "note": "14,430 lb = 6,542 kg per NAVAIR's direct MH-60S product page, explicitly lower than the MH-60R's 15,170 lb empty weight (also independently confirmed on NAVAIR's separate MH-60R page in this same search pass) since the S-model lacks the R's dedicated ASW sensor suite (dipping sonar, sonobuoy launcher, APS-153 radar)"},
